# Implementation plan — Spec 1.15.0

## Summary

Add **Calendar** to **company_admin** left nav and a WebOnOne **`/calendar`** page that shows a **full calendar** with **Day**, **Week**, and **Month** views. Implement the board as UI Kit **`FullCalendar`** (keep compact `Calendar` for DatePicker). No events API in this release.

See [02-ui-kit-full-calendar.md](./02-ui-kit-full-calendar.md), [04-company-admin-calendar-nav.md](./04-company-admin-calendar-nav.md), [05-calendar-page.md](./05-calendar-page.md).

