**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root`

## Forbidden

- Third-party calendar libraries
- Events CRUD / migrations
- Calendar on member or super_admin nav without spec revision
- Peer-dialog / iframe for this page
- Breaking compact `Calendar` / `DatePicker`
- Hand-rolled day/week/month grids in WebOnOne

